&lt;p&gt;Current URL:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131016051444/http:/www.lineto.com/The+Fonts/Font+Categories/Text+Fonts/Number+Two/" title="http://www.lineto.com/The+Fonts/Font+Categories/Text+Fonts/Number+Two/"&gt;http://www.lineto.com/The+Fonts/Font+Categories/Text+Fonts/Number+Two/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed by &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131016051444/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Martha%20Stutteregger"&gt;Martha Stutteregger&lt;/a&gt; 1996&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Published by &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131016051444/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Lineto"&gt;Lineto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An early &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131016051444/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Sans%20serif"&gt;Sans serif&lt;/a&gt; typeface called &amp;ldquo;Berthold Schmale Runde Grotesk&amp;rdquo; inspired me for this design. It is beautifully suited for headlines, but works surprisingly well even for text setting.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>